{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29386","headline":"碧瓦 · 李商隐","name":"碧瓦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧瓦衔珠树，红轮结绮寮。\n无双汉殿鬓，第一楚宫腰。\n雾唾香难尽，珠啼冷易销。\n歌从雍门学，酒是蜀城烧。\n柳暗将翻巷，荷欹正抱桥。\n钿辕开道入，金管隔隣调。\n梦到飞魂急，书成即席遥。\n河流冲柱转，海沫近槎飘。\n吴市蠀蛦甲，巴賨翡翠翘。\n他时未知意，重叠赠娇饶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}